solution:
The plates are equal sizes so all we have to do is simply balance the shear stresses which act in opposing directions on the middle plate:
$$
\begin{gathered}
\tau_{1}=\tau_{2} \\
\eta_{1} \cdot \frac{v_{1}}{d_{1}}=\eta_{2} \cdot \frac{v_{2}}{d_{2}} \\
10 \cdot \frac{2}{0.1}=15 \frac{v}{0.2} \\
v=2.667 \mathrm{~m} / \mathrm{s}
\end{gathered}
$$
